<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15996" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ĕpistŭlāris</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">epistol-</span></b> , v. epistula <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>init.</i>),
			e, adj.
			epistula, <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to a letter</i>, <i>epistolary.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">chartae,</span>”
				<i>letter-paper</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					14, 11</span></i>
			
			<i>in lemm.;</i>
			<i><span class="en">Dig. 33, 9, 3, § 10</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">colloquium,</span>”
				<i>epistolary</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Aug. Ep. ad Marcell. 5</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">epistŭlāris</span></b> , is,
				f., <i>a messenger</i> of the Eagle of
			Jupiter: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">epistularis tua,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 9, § 896</span></i>
			.—<i>Plur.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">epistulāres</span></b> , ium,
				m., <i>state secretaries</i>, Cod. Th.
			6, 30, 7.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
